1-3 and 1-7 always gives you one piece of gear each• Fewer enemies spawn in 1-1 and 1-2, so the first clear takes less time• Drop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:03:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038751","verified_at":"2026-10-24T07:29:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1846651706691439","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is live: play the MindGate CornerGet demo now","summary":"Steam Next Fest has started. The MindGate CornerGet demo is ready to play right now.What kind of game is it?It is an idle loot-and-fight game played in a thin strip on your taskbar, where tiny characters take on the enemies. It keeps going even if you do nothing. Open the dashboard when you feel like it and swap in the gear that dropped. That is all you have to do.What you can do in the demo• You can play the first layer of difficulty (Mind Layer 0). The other layers are planned to arrive as fre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1846651706690511","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"announcement","title":"b952: Key Boss 3 “Keyward Skull”, magatama fusion and removal, new Enforcer art","summary":"Key Boss 3 “Keyward Skull” added, and magatama can now be fused and removedWe added Key Boss 3, the Keyward Skull. We also improved how magatama are organized, gear comparison, the Enforcer’s art, and more.Key bosses• Key Boss 3, the Keyward Skull, appears at the shrine in Act 3. It is the Act 3 Gashadokuro, clad in golden bones and pale blue will-o’-wisps• You can challenge it after beating Key Bosses 1 and 2. Its rewards are more likely to be of higher rarity than those of Key Bosses 1 and 2Ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:27:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1846651706679512","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"update","title":"b951 Update: Night Parade boss rebalance, new gear and background art","summary":"Night Parade boss rebalanced, with new gear and background artWe rebalanced the Night Parade boss (the Gashadokuro). This update also brings new gear art and new backgrounds for the regular stages, and a few fixes to the Band.Night Parade• Fixed the boss going a long time without throwing anything after it stops. Until the night ends, it now throws bones and fire breath 6 times• Evened out the strength of its attacks. Nights 3 and 4 are somewhat easier, and Night 5 is a bit harderGear and backgr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:02:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1846018067936107","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Night Parade is here (b950)","summary":"A new mode, the Night Parade, is here. This update also brings skill fixes, bug fixes and display cleanup.The Night Parade• Available once you reach Act 2.• As you play, the moon at the top right of the screen fills up. Click the full moon to start a night: a battle of about 90 seconds in which you defend the torii from a horde of yokai• In the demo, you can store up to 3 moons• Nights 1 to 5 are available. Once you hold a night for the first time, the next night becomes selectable. Choose the n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T12:04:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1845383656388297","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update (b944)","summary":"We have updated the demo based on your reports and what we noticed while playing. Thank you for sending them in.Fixes• Fixed a bug where you could not drag a reserve character back into the party on the Team screen. Dropping on an empty slot, on a deployed character, or on a formation slot now all return them to the party• Fixed chest and inventory behavior. Among other things, you could fail to receive a boss's first Legendary gear or the guaranteed first-clear gear when the chest was full. Key","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T03:35:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1845383656381098","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Out Now — Joining Steam Next Fest","summary":"The free demo of MindGate CornerGet is now available on Steam. You can start playing right from this store page.MindGate CornerGet is an idle hack-and-slash where your characters keep fighting on their own in a thin strip on your taskbar. Leave it running next to your work, and swap in the gear you find whenever you feel like it.What's in the demo• 4 areas x 10 stages• 5 characters (you start with 1; more join as you progress, up to 3 in your party)• 10 equipment slots, with random effects and v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:34:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4913350-1843481262690291","game_id":"steam-4913350","kind":"announcement","title":"Now available in 17 languages","summary":"CornerGet now supports 17 languages.Newly addedFrench / German / Italian / Indonesian / Ukrainian / Vietnamese / PolishAlready supported: Japanese, English, Spanish (Spain and Latin America), Portuguese (Brazil), Russian, Turkish, Korean, and Chinese (Simplified and Traditional).The text is written in Japanese and machine-translated into the other languages. If you spot something that reads wrong, please let me know.A demo is coming later this month, and CornerGet will be in Steam Next Fest star","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T20:03:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4913350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4913350":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4913350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z"},"5321550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:15:26Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4913350","app_id":4913350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:06Z","source_url":"https://a